What this does:

- `cloneItems` performs a **full** recursive clone of your `dataSource`, so that none of the original frozen objects are ever mutated.
- We then hand the cloned `dataSource` into `<Cascader>` instead of the raw `this.props.dataSource`.

With this in place, Cascader’s internal bookkeeping (`pos`, `_v2n`, `_p2n`, etc.) all end up on your clones, and your frozen Immer-state stays untouched.
